 been found for this gene. [provided by RefSeq, Jul 2010].","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"O00400","text":"Acetyl-CoA transporter that mediates active acetyl-CoA import through the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) membrane into the ER lumen where specific ER-based acetyl-CoA:lysine acetyltransferases are responsible for the acetylation of ER-based protein substrates, such as BACE1 (PubMed:20826464, PubMed:24828632). Necessary for O-acetylation of gangliosides (PubMed:9096318)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}